    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nFINANCE ACT, No. 21 OF 2019\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n[Certified on 31st of October, 2019]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 12.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of November 01, 2019\n\nThis Act can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1Finance Act, No. 21 of 2019\n\nShort title.\n\n[Certified on 31st of October, 2019]\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 15/2019\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE FINANCE ACT, NO. 35 OF 2018; TO PROVIDE\n\nFOR THE IMPOSITION OF A FOREIGN COMMERCIAL TRANSACTIONSLEVY; AND TO PROVIDE FOR THE MATTERS CONNECTED THEREWITH\n\nAND INCIDENTAL THERETO.\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2013\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Finance Act, No. 21 of2019.\n\nPART I\n\nAMENDMENT OF PART VII OF THE FINANCE ACT, NO. 35 OF 2018\n\n2.Section 23 of the Finance Act, No. 35 of 2018 ishereby amended by the substitution for the definition of theexpression \u201cspecified motor vehicle\u201d of the followingdefinition:\u2014\n\n\u201c \u201cspecified motor vehicle\u201d\u2014\n\n(a)in relation to a vehicle of which the firstregistration falls prior to November 1, 2019,means any assembled or unassembled dieselmotor vehicle of which the cylinder capacityexceeds 2,300 CC or a petrol motor vehicle ofwhich the cylinder capacity exceeds 1,800 CCor an electric vehicle of which motor power ofthe engine exceeds 200 Kw, but shall not includea dual purpose petrol motor vehicle of whichthe cylinder capacity does not exceed 2,200 CC,a dual purpose electric motor vehicle, a van,a single cab or a wagon;\n\nAmendment ofsection 23 ofAct,No. 35 of 2018.\n\n2Finance Act, No. 21 of 2019"
