    "chunk_size_bytes": 1579,
    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n[Certified on 26th of February 2020]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 16.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of February 28, 2020\n\nThis Act can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nINSTITUTE OF ENVIRONMENTALPROFESSIONALS, SRI LANKA (INCORPORATION)ACT, No. 1 OF 2020\n\nInstitute of Environmental Professionals,Sri Lanka (Incorporation) Act, No. 1 of 20201\n\n[Certified on 26th of February, 2020]\n\nL.D.\u2014O. (INC) 10/ 2015\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE INSTITUTE OF ENVIRONMENTALPROFESSIONALS, SRI LANKA\n\nWHEREAS an Institute called and known as the\u201cInstitute of Environmental Professionals, Sri Lanka\u201d hasheretofore been established in Sri Lanka for the purpose ofeffectually carrying out its objects and transacting all mattersconnected with the said Institute according to the rules agreedto by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Institute has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be for the public advantage togrant the said application:\n\nBE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Institute ofEnvironmental Professionals, Sri Lanka (Incorporation) Act,No. 1 of 2020."
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_acts",
    "doc_id": "2020-02-26-2020-02-26-01-2020-en",
    "num": "2020-02-26-01-2020-en",
    "date_str": "2020-02-26",
    "description": "Institute of Environmental Professionals, Sri Lanka (Incorporation)",
    "url_metadata": "https://documents.gov.lk/view/acts/acts_2020.html",
    "lang": "en",
    "url_pdf": "https://documents.gov.lk/view/acts/2020/2/01-2020_E.pdf",
