    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 85.00Postage : Rs. 35.00\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of September 23, 2022\n\nThis Act can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n[Certified on 20th of September, 2022]\n\nSOCIAL SECURITY CONTRIBUTION LEVYACT, No. 25 OF 2022\n\n1Social Security Contribution LevyAct, No. 25 of 2022\n\nShort title anddate ofoperation\n\nL.D.-O. 81/2021\n\nAN ACT TO PROVIDE FOR THE IMPOSITION AND COLLECTION OF A LEVY\n\nKNOWN AS THE SOCIAL SECURITY CONTRIBUTION LEVY ON THE LIABLE\n\nTURNOVER OF EVERY PERSON TO WHOM THIS ACT APPLIES; AND TO\n\nPROVIDE FOR MATTERS CONNECTED THEREWITH OR INCIDENTAL THERETO.\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Social SecurityContribution Levy Act, No. 25 of 2022 and shall come intooperation on the First day of October 2022.\n\nPART I\n\nIMPOSITION OF SOCIAL SECURITYCONTRIBUTION LEVY\n\n2. The provisions of this Act shall apply to every person(in this Act referred to as a \u201ctaxable person\u201d) who -\n\n(a)imports any article;\n\n(b)carries on the business of manufacture of any article;\n\n(c)carries on the business of providing a service ofany description; or\n\n(d)carries on the business of wholesale or retail sale ofany article including importation and sale of sucharticle other than a sale by the manufacturer of thatarticle being a manufacturer to whom the provisionsof paragraph (b) applies.\n\n3. (1) A levy known as the \u201cSocial Security ContributionLevy\u201d (in this Act referred to as \u201cthe levy\u201d) shall, subject tothe provisions of this Act, be charged from every taxableperson for every quarter (in this Act referred to as the \u201crelevant\n\nPersons towhom this Actapplies\n\nImposition ofthe SocialSecurityContributionLevy"
