ipal enactment is hereby amendedby the substitution for the words, \u201cDeputy Commissionersfor Ayurveda,\u201d of the words \u201cAdditional Commissioner-Generals for Ayurveda, Commissioners for Ayurveda,Deputy Commissioners for Ayurveda,\u201d."
