    "chunk_text": "(a) not later than fifteen days from the date ofoperation of this Act, in the case of a taxableperson whose aggregate of the turnover,within the twelve months period immediatelyprior to the date of operation of this Act,exceeded one hundred and twenty millionrupees;\n\nShort title\n\nAmendment ofsection 4 of Act,No. 25 of 2022\n\n2Social Security Contribution Levy(Amendment) Act, No. 15 of 2024\n\nAmendment ofsection 5 of theprincipalenactment\n\n(c) for any period commencing on or afterJanuary 1, 2024, not later than fifteen daysfrom the date on which the aggregate of theturnover for a quarter exceeds or likely toexceed fifteen million rupees or from the dateon which the aggregate of the turnover for aperiod of consecutive four quarters exceedsor likely to exceed sixty million rupees:\n\nProvided that, a taxable person to whom paragraph(c) applies shall be deemed to have complied with therequirement of registration under this subsection, if suchperson makes an application for such purpose to theCommissioner-General in the specified form not laterthan fifteen days from the date of operation of this(Amendment) Act.\u201d.\n\n3. Section 5 of the principal enactment is hereby amendedin subsection (1) thereof as follows:-\n\n(1)in paragraph (a) thereof, by the substitution for thewords and figure \u201cin section 2; or\u201d, of the wordsand figure \u201cin section 2;\u201d;\n\n(2)in paragraph (b) thereof, by the substitution for thewords \u201ceach immediately preceding four quartersof the relevant quarter does not exceed hundredand twenty million rupees.\u201d, of the words and figures\u201ceach immediately preceding four quarters of therelevant quarter prior to January 1, 2024, does notexceed hundred and twenty million rupees; or\u201d;and\n\n3Social Security Contribution Levy(Amendment) Act, No. 15 of 2024\n\nSinhala text toprevail in caseof inconsistency\n\n(3)by the addition immediately after paragraph(b) thereof, of the following:-"
