    "chunk_text": "Price : Rs. 35.00Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\nThis Act can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nLocal Authorities Elections (Special Provisions)\n\nAct, N0. 1 0f 2025\n\n1\n\nAN ACT TO PROVIDE FOR THE CALLING OF FRESH\n\nPreamble\n\nL.D.- O 76/2024\n\n[Certified on 17th of February, 2015]\n\nPL 15051 - 150 (02/2025)\n\nLocal Authorities Elections (Special Provisions)\n\nAct, N0. 1 0f 2025 2\n\nProvisions relating to nominations, notices and deposits in respect of elections to certain Local Authorities\n\nAND WHEREAS due to the period of time that has elapsed since the submission of nominations in respect of such Local Authorities set out in the Schedule hereto, it has become necessary to provide for the calling of fresh nominations and to make provisions for the holding of fresh elections in respect of such Local Authorities set out in the Schedule hereto: NOW THEREFORE, BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :-\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Local Authorities Elections (Special Provisions) Act, No. 1 of 2025. 2. (1) Nomination papers submitted for the Local Authorities elections due to be held on March 9, 2023 under section 28 of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cOrdinance\u201d) in respect of the Local Authorities set out in the Schedule hereto in response to the notices of nominations published under section 26 of the Ordinance are hereby deemed to be of no force and effect as if such nomination papers had never been submitted.\n\n(2) The notices published under subsection (1) of section 38 of the Ordinance, in respect of elections to the Local Authorities set out in the Schedule hereto are hereby revoked."
