    "chunk_text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Local Authorities Elections (Special Provisions) Act, No. 1 of 2025. 2. (1) Nomination papers submitted for the Local Authorities elections due to be held on March 9, 2023 under section 28 of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cOrdinance\u201d) in respect of the Local Authorities set out in the Schedule hereto in response to the notices of nominations published under section 26 of the Ordinance are hereby deemed to be of no force and effect as if such nomination papers had never been submitted.\n\n(2) The notices published under subsection (1) of section 38 of the Ordinance, in respect of elections to the Local Authorities set out in the Schedule hereto are hereby revoked.\n\nShort title\n\nLocal Authorities Elections (Special Provisions)\n\nAct, N0. 1 0f 2025\n\n3\n\nSinhala text to prevail in case of inconsistency\n\nSteps to be commenced for holding of elections\n\n3. Steps shall be commenced under the provisions of the Ordinance for the holding of elections to the Local Authorities set out in the Schedule hereto:\n\nProvided that, the notices of nominations in terms of section 26 of the Ordinance shall be published on such date as the Election Commission may determine by Order published in the Gazette and such date shall however, be a date not later than three months from the date of coming into operation of this Act.\n\n4. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhala and Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nDistrict Local Authority\n\n(01) Colombo 1 Colombo Municipal Council\n\n2 Dehiwala - Mt. Lavinia Municipal Council\n\n3 Sri Jayawardenepura Kotte Municipal Council\n\n4 Kaduwela Municipal Council\n\n5 Moratuwa Municipal Council\n\n6 Kollonnawa Urban Council\n\n7 Seethawakapura Urban Council\n\n8 Maharagama Urban Council\n\n9 Kesbewa Urban Council\n\n10 Boralesgamuwa Urban Council\n\n11 Kotikawatta Mulleriyawa Pradeshiya